### 1. Add an Exam Room
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/exam/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roomName": "Hall 1",
    "capacity": 4,
    "rows": 2,
    "cols": 2
}

### 2. Add a Student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/exam/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Tarun",
    "rollNumber": "BCA001",
    "department": "BCA"
}

### 3. Trigger Seating Allocation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/exam/allocate